<title>GERMANY: Lufthansa Oct pax load factor 74.9pct.</title>
<headline>Lufthansa Oct pax load factor 74.9pct.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Lufthansa AG increased its group passenger load factor to 74.9 percent in October, up 1.2 percentage points from one year ago, the airline's investor relations department said in its latest monthly report.</p>
<p>The following table shows traffic for October 1996.</p>
<p>Total passengers (group) (million)   3.98  up 2.6 pct</p>
<p>Available seat kilometres (million) 10.29  up 2.4 pct</p>
<p>Revenue seat kilometres (million)    7.7   up 4.1 pct</p>
<p>Passenger load factor		   74.9   up 1.2 pct points</p>
<p>--Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax +44 171 542 5017</p>
</text>
